% gen342: words that directly denote a color. This supports compositional
% questions where the answer is already present as an adjective in the input:
% "what color is the white horse?" / "di che colore è il cavallo bianco?".
% C only asks color_word(Token, Color); the vocabulary and translation live here.
% gen342: generic attribute-contained-in-input schema. A dimension declares the
% question cue that asks for it and the words that can fill it. This generalizes
% the white-horse case to material and other dimensions without more C.
